{
  "category": "ambiguity",
  "note": "Homographs that only context decides. Each case states the reading that is right IN THAT SENTENCE; `first` fails when that reading is not the analyser's first. Gender pairs (le/la tour, le/la voile, le/la vase, le/la mode) expect the gender. An AI's judgement, not native-reviewed.",
